# The counter-melody (PLUCK): two pages in the ARP button's cycle (Acid, Acid env, Acid line, Acid answer, Acid steps, Pluck, Pluck 2, Deja vu), a Sound that SEL + ALGORITHM
# steps, a mute (GLO + B4) and a solo (GLO + F#5) of its own.
wait 3000
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
expect view 11
tap ARP
expect view 12
tap ARP
expect view 13
tap ARP
expect view 14
expect par98 30
turn K1 1
expect par98 31
turn K2 2
expect par99 3
wait 2000
shot pluck1.png
press SEL
turn ALGO 1
release SEL
expect par99 4
tap ARP
expect view 15
turn K2 1
expect par103 1
turn K3 1
expect par104 3
wait 2000
shot pluck2.png
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
expect view 9
press GLO
tapkey 18
release GLO
expect trkmute 128
press GLO
tapkey 25
release GLO
expect trksolo 128
press GLO
tapkey 23
release GLO
expect trkmute 0
expect trksolo 0